>
  <p>A slab looks simple, which is exactly why so many are done badly. Get the base wrong by an inch and the building on top tells you about it for years. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> pours concrete slabs across Toronto and the GTA: garage floors, shed and workshop pads, addition floors, hot tub pads and parking pads.</p>

  <p>We spec every slab for its actual load. A shed pad and a garage slab are different jobs: different thickness, different reinforcement, different base depth. You get the slab your project needs, not a one-size pour.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete slab service</h2>
  <p>Every slab job is priced as a complete package in a written quote:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Layout to your footprint</strong>, including prefab manufacturer specs</li>
    <li><strong>Excavation and a compacted granular base</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Thickness and reinforcement</strong> matched to the load</li>
    <li><strong>Forms, pour and finish</strong>, level and square</li>
    <li><strong>Control joints</strong> placed to manage shrinkage</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> and clear curing guidance</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Slabs and the jobs around them</h2>
  <p>A garage slab usually comes with a <a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">driveway</a> or apron, and a backyard pad often pairs with a <a href="/services/concrete-patios/">patio</a> or <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">walkway</a>. Bundling the flatwork into one visit gets you one quote, one schedule and a consistent finish across the property.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of concrete work across Toronto and the GTA, hundreds of jobs behind us, and every slab backed by a 2-year warranty and our satisfaction guarantee.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every pour</li>
    <li>On schedule, every time</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We pour slabs across the GTA, from Toronto to <a href="/locations/pickering/">Pickering</a> and <a href="/locations/ajax/">Ajax</a>. See every area on our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a> page.</p>
